- x-g2: G2 [GOAL-PUB-RULES-AT-PUBLICATION] is carried by [DD-PUB-FAIL-CLOSED-IN-PUBLICATION-MODE] and [REQ-PUB-FAIL-CLOSED], and tested by [SCEN-PUB-MISSING-OR-EMPTY] and [SCEN-PUB-CONTROL-FAILS], which bind publication mode only. [DD-PUB-DROP-PER-CHANGE-TEST] records when the per-change test goes.
- x-g3: G3 [GOAL-PUB-PUSH-MAINTAINER-DECISION] is carried by [REQ-PUB-NO-PUBLIC-WRITE], [REQ-PUB-NO-PUSH-CODE] and [DD-PUB-PUSH-SCRIPT-ON-MAINTAINER-WORD], and tested by [SCEN-PUB-TOKEN-CANNOT-PUSH] and [SCEN-PUB-PUSH-FAST-FORWARD-ONLY]. [DD-PUB-NO-REQUIRED-REVIEWER-AVAILABLE] records why the push is a delegate's command and not a gated workflow step.
- x-g4: G4 [GOAL-PUB-NO-SILENT-UNCONFIGURED] is carried by [REQ-PUB-FAIL-CLOSED], [REQ-PUB-SCOPE-LINE], [REQ-PUB-DRIFT-VISIBLE], [REQ-PUB-UNCONFIGURED-SAYS-SO] and [DD-PUB-FAIL-CLOSED-IN-PUBLICATION-MODE], and tested by [SCEN-PUB-MISSING-OR-EMPTY], [SCEN-PUB-CONTROL-FAILS], [SCEN-PUB-CLEAN-SNAPSHOT], [SCEN-PUB-DRIFT] and [SCEN-PUB-UNCONFIGURED-NOT-CLEAN].
